<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίζῠγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον </span>(
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ichn.</u>
			168
		</span></i>), and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίζυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span>, ὁ, ἡ,<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>three-yoked, three in union,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαρίτων τριζύγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					545
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίζυγοι θεαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					357
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριζυγέες Χάριτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.27
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίζυγες κασίγνητοι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.181
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>triple,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριζύγης οἵμου βάσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίζυγον ἑβδομάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					3.216
				</span></i>
			 (Attica, <span class="entity">ii/i B. C.</span>).</div>
